        <description>PAN-35652: Hands the invoice to ABT_StripeInvoiceDispatcher, which marks it Queued and enqueues ABT_StripeInvoiceProcessor (one invoice per Queueable transaction = fresh callout budget). No Stripe callout runs in this record-triggered transaction, which removes the batch-concurrency callout exhaustion (PAN-35684). Replaces the dead-end Mark_Queued_For_Stripe update so a Queued invoice actually reaches the processor.</description>
